# sys-giratina-caught: focused room coverage (story branch: m5-giratina-caught).
# The Giratina room's native script, caught. A constructed start (setup lines) at progress 13
# (GIRATINA_ARRIVED); the room's objects are the Distortion World's (Giratina at progress 13, Cynthia and Cyrus added
# by the script). A on Giratina: start_giratina_origin_battle 487, 47
# (Origin form, TERRAIN_GIRATINA), caught with a Master Ball: get_battle_result 4, FLAG_CAUGHT_GIRATINA, the
# Turnback Cave Giratina hidden and its item shown; the field's return runs the on-load script
# (FLAG_MAP_LOCAL_REMOVE_OBJECT): progress 14 (BATTLED_GIRATINA), Giratina's object removed; then Cyrus's lines.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 100 platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
give item platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 1
set var platinum:VAR_DISTORTION_WORLD_PROGRESS 13
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_DISTORTION_WORLD_GIRATINA_ROOM 15 14 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
battle catch platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 20000
+0 assert battle scripted platinum:SPECIES_GIRATINA caught
advance text 20000
until idle 3000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_GIRATINA true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM_GIRATINA true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM_ITEM false
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_MAP_LOCAL_REMOVE_OBJECT false
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_DISTORTION_WORLD_PROGRESS 14
+0 assert party 1 platinum:SPECIES_GIRATINA
+0 assert state party[1].form 1
